= Executive summary

#quote(block: true)[Innovation earns trust when engineering quality, responsible operations, and measurable customer value move together.]

The programme combines three practical priorities: make critical processes easier to observe,
reduce avoidable material and energy use, and shorten the path from a proven idea to repeatable
delivery. Each workstream has a named owner and a measurable result.

